a normal secretary called Janet,
and a normal desk.

161
00:08:32,480 --> 00:08:34,480
他就喜欢低调不显眼。
He likes to blend.

162
00:08:34,520 --> 00:08:38,640
你这辈子见过几个商务人士
穿一身酸橙绿西装的？
How many businessmen have you ever seen
in a lime green suit?

163
00:08:41,080 --> 00:08:43,120
这意味着他想要一辆正常的车，
That means he wants a normal car

164
00:08:43,160 --> 00:08:45,480
有后备箱，有引擎盖，
中间顶着个车顶，
with a boot and a bonnet
and a roof in between,

165
00:08:45,520 --> 00:08:47,480
而不是某种看起来像是
not something that appears to have come

166
00:08:47,520 --> 00:08:49,760
杰里·安德森脑洞大开搞出来的玩意儿。
from the mind of Gerry Anderson.

167
00:08:59,560 --> 00:09:01,280
搞这些巧思确实挺有一套，比如
It's all very well, matching

168
00:09:01,320 --> 00:09:04,120
把油箱加注口盖上的凹痕，
the indentation in the fuel filler cap

169
00:09:04,160 --> 00:09:06,480
严丝合缝对上保险杠上的凹痕，
to the indentations in the bumper,

170
00:09:06,520 --> 00:09:09,760
还弄了张信用卡似的东西来代替车钥匙。
and having a credit card instead of a key.

171
00:09:09,800 --> 00:09:12,360
而且我也确信，那些戴着波诺同款潮人墨镜的家伙
And I'm sure people in trendy Bono glasses

172
00:09:12,400 --> 00:09:17,200
肯定会很中意这锯齿状的屁股
和古怪的车头。
will appreciate the zig-zaggy rear end
and the unusual nose.

173
00:09:17,240 --> 00:09:22,240
然而雷诺应该明白，英国的生意人
可受不了这种古怪又激进的玩意儿。
Renault, however, should know that British
businessmen don't like wacky and radical.

174
00:09:22,280 --> 00:09:25,360
这是雷诺在斯温顿的旧仓储中心。
This is Renault's old store centre
in Swindon.

175
00:09:25,400 --> 00:09:27,120
很壮观，对吧？
Amazing, isn't it?

176
00:09:27,160 --> 00:09:29,440
壮观，而且空荡荡的。
Amazing and empty.

177
00:09:29,480 --> 00:09:31,920
如今根本无人问津。
Today, no one wants it.

178
00:09:34,560 --> 00:09:36,520
你知道吗？
HAMMOND:  继续说。
You know what?
HAMMOND:  Go on.

179
00:09:36,560 --> 00:09:41,160
我又不是商务人士，我其实挺喜欢这车的外形。
I'm not a businessman and I love the looks
of this car.

180
00:09:41,200 --> 00:09:42,480
那你买吗？
So, would you buy one?

181
00:09:42,520 --> 00:09:44,440
不买，因为这车烂透了。
No, 'cause it's a rubbish car.

182
00:09:44,480 --> 00:09:47,360
不过，其实我知道
怎么形容它最贴切。
But, actually, I know
the best way to describe it.

183
00:09:47,400 --> 00:09:49,200
你知道印度菜吧？
You know Indian food?

184
00:09:49,240 --> 00:09:51,440
听好了，不是你在英国印度餐馆里吃到的那些。
Okay. Not the stuff you get
in Indian restaurants in England.

185
00:09:51,480 --> 00:09:53,640
我说的是真正的印度菜，懂吗？
I'm talking about Indian food, okay?

186
00:09:53,680 --> 00:09:57,640
用的肉根本不咋地，所以才浇了
一层味道极冲的浓重酱汁。
It's not very good quality meat so that's
why it has that very powerful sauce on it.

187
00:09:57,680 --> 00:10:02,600
这车就是这么回事：劣质的烂肉，
上面浇了一层重口无比的酱汁。
And that's what this is, poor quality meat,
very powerful sauce on the top.

188
00:10:02,640 --> 00:10:05,920
它就像是一份“雷诺贾尔弗雷齐咖喱”。
It's a sort of Renault Jalfrezi.

189
00:10:05,960 --> 00:10:07,040
[观众大笑]
[AUDIENCE LAUGHING]

190
00:10:07,080 --> 00:10:08,640
而且关键在于，
And the thing is,

191
00:10:08,680 --> 00:10:11,360
这还不单单是一次罗恩·戴维斯式的偶然发疯。
this isn't just a one-off Ron Davies moment
of madness either.

192
00:10:11,400 --> 00:10:14,480
它蔓延到了整个车系，
因为眼前这台是全新梅甘娜。
It's across the range
because this is the new Megane.

193
00:10:14,520 --> 00:10:16,800
从正面看，嗯，
长得还挺中规中矩。
And from the front, yeah,
it looks pretty conventional.

194
00:10:16,840 --> 00:10:18,680
引擎盖底下也挺中规中矩。
It's pretty conventional under the bonnet.

195
00:10:18,720 --> 00:10:23,240
你可以选1.4、1.6或2.0升的汽油机，
或者一台1.9升的柴油机。
You can have a 1.4, 1.6 or 2-litre
petrol engine or a 1.9-litre diesel.

196
00:10:23,280 --> 00:10:27,920
价格也很传统，
起售价在10,500到15,500英镑之间。
Prices are conventional too,
starting from £10,500-15,500.

197
00:10:27,960 --> 00:10:29,840
我开过了。
I have driven it.

198
00:10:29,880 --> 00:10:31,520
我真希望能说它开起来
也完全挑不出毛病，
I would love to be able to say
it was entirely conventional to drive

199
00:10:31,560 --> 00:10:33,040
但坦白讲，它连合格线都够得费劲。
but frankly, it struggles to get there.

200
00:10:33,080 --> 00:10:34,560
确实挺拉胯的。
It is a bit poor.

201
00:10:34,600 --> 00:10:37,160
但它刚刚被评为了
国际年度风云车，
But it's just been voted
International Car of the Year

202
00:10:37,200 --> 00:10:39,040
我唯一能想到的原因，
and I can only imagine that it did that

203
00:10:39,080 --> 00:10:41,640
大概是评委们忘了
去看它的屁股。
because the judges forgot
to look at the back.

204
00:10:41,680 --> 00:10:43,640
他们彻底疯了！
They've gone completely berserk!

205
00:10:43,680 --> 00:10:46,280
这简直是雷诺搞出的双重车祸现场。
This is a Renault Double Foul.

206
00:10:46,320 --> 00:10:49,600
不过你要真想见识什么叫疯癫，
那你得看看这台！
If you want berserk,
then you want to look at this, though!

207
00:10:49,640 --> 00:10:51,800
这就是雷诺Avantime。
This is the Renault Avantime.

208
00:10:51,840 --> 00:10:53,960
按理说，这应该算一辆双门轿跑。
Now, this is meant to be a coupé.

209
00:10:54,000 --> 00:10:57,640
你看，它没有B柱，但他们居然
把它造在了MPV的底盘上。
Look there is no pillars, but they've
built it on the platform of an MPV.

210
00:10:57,680 --> 00:11:01,160
我觉得它简直帅炸了。
I think it's absolutely fantastic.

211
00:11:01,200 --> 00:11:02,240
你开什么玩笑！
You're joking!

212
00:11:02,280 --> 00:11:04,200
我爱死这车了。
I adore this car.

213
00:11:04,240 --> 00:11:06,920
前几天我还跟雷诺的
设计总监聊过。
I actually was talking to the Renault
design boss the other day.

214
00:11:06,960 --> 00:11:11,240
我说我正认真考虑要买一台，
他当时的反应是：“买一台？”
I said I am actually thinking of buying one
and he was like, "Buying one?"

215
00:11:11,280 --> 00:11:12,760
“呃……好吧。”
"Erm... Right."

216
00:11:12,800 --> 00:11:14,840
接着他说：“行吧，你要真买，
And he said, "Well, if you are,

217
00:11:14,880 --> 00:11:17,520
记得联系我们，我们看看能不能
专门给你好好拼装一台靠谱的。”
do get in touch and we'll see
if we can build one properly for you."

218
00:11:17,560 --> 00:11:20,080
[众人大笑]
不，说真的，他真是这么说的！
[ALL LAUGHING]
No, seriously, he did!

219
00:11:20,120 --> 00:11:22,000
呃，根据我某些内线消息，
早期的那些车，
Well, some of my sources
said that actually, the early cars,

220
00:11:22,040 --> 00:11:25,200
也就是量产前的试装车，这里的车身强度
出了很大问题，
the pre-production models, they had a
problem with the strength in here

221
00:11:25,240 --> 00:11:27,080
因为很明显，它没有B柱，
because obviously there is no B-pillar

222
00:11:27,120 --> 00:11:29,320
结果那车开起来
中间居然会上下晃荡扭曲。
and the cars were actually
kind of flexing in the middle.

223
00:11:29,360 --> 00:11:30,960
我根本不在乎。
I just don't care.

224
00:11:31,000 --> 00:11:34,320
你想想，两万四千英镑，
如果你想要一台四座车，
You know, for £24,000,
if you want a four-seater car,

225
00:11:34,360 --> 00:11:36,360
还要带点逼格，这车绝对是无敌的。
bit of style, you just can't beat this.

226
00:11:36,400 --> 00:11:39,280
我唯一要说的是，
千万别买红色或蓝色的，听见没？
The only thing I would say,
don't go for the red or the blue, okay?

227
00:11:39,320 --> 00:11:41,440
那太土了。
It's too boring.

228
00:11:41,480 --> 00:11:46,720
一定要选那种金属豌豆糊绿，
再配个银色车顶。啵儿！完美！
Go for the metallic kind of
mushy-pea green with the silver roof. Mwah!

229
00:11:46,760 --> 00:11:48,480
[众人大笑]
~ 你脑子有毛病吧！
[ALL LAUGHING]
- You're weird!

230
00:11:48,520 --> 00:11:50,280
几周前，
A few weeks ago,

231
00:11:50,320 --> 00:11:52,880
我们打算证明一下，
老年人其实车技也很棒。
we set out to prove
that older people can drive well.

232
00:11:52,920 --> 00:11:56,440
于是我们找来了一群老奶奶，
现在屏幕上的就是其中几位。
So, we got together a group of grannies
and here are a few of them now.

233
00:11:56,480 --> 00:11:58,520
接着我们让她们玩了这个。
And we got them to do this.

234
00:11:58,560 --> 00:11:59,960
[发动机轰鸣]
拉斯·斯威夫特：再踩深点，漂亮。
[REVVING]
RUSS SWIFT: Harder, that's good.

235
00:12:00,000 --> 00:12:01,280
稳住，稳住，
保持住。
Keep it there, keep it there,
keep it there.

236
00:12:01,320 --> 00:12:02,400
[轮胎尖叫]
[TYRES SCREECH]

237
00:12:02,440 --> 00:12:07,160
[两人兴奋地大笑]
[BOTH LAUGHING EXCITEDLY]

238
00:12:07,200 --> 00:12:10,840
由于她们开得实在太出色了，我们觉得
必须来点难度更高的花样。
And they were all so good, we thought
we'd try something a little bit trickier.

239
00:12:10,860 --> 00:12:12,980
♪ Röyksopp - Eple ♪
♪ Röyksopp - Eple ♪

240
00:12:13,000 --> 00:12:15,680
今天，我们和拉斯·斯威夫特
以及老奶奶们又回来了。
We're back today with Russ Swift
and the grannies.

241
00:12:15,720 --> 00:12:18,600
今天呢，我们要教她们
手刹甩尾停车。
And today, we're going to teach
them to do handbrake parking.

242
00:12:18,640 --> 00:12:21,600
要是你还不知道手刹甩尾停车是什么，
瞧好了。
If you don't know
what handbrake parking is, watch this.

243
00:12:25,600 --> 00:12:26,800
姑娘们，觉得怎么样，敢上吗？
What do you reckon, girls, you gonna do it?

244
00:12:26,840 --> 00:12:30,440
众人：敢啊，敢！为什么不呢？试试就试试！
ALL: Yes, yes. Why not? Have a go!

245
00:12:30,480 --> 00:12:33,680
她们显然压根不知道
自己即将面对的是什么。
They clearly haven't got a clue
what they're about to try.

246
00:12:36,840 --> 00:12:39,360
拉斯，你可是侧方停车界的王者。
Russ, you're the king of parallel parking.

247
00:12:39,400 --> 00:12:41,760
你看上去做得轻轻松松，
但实际上这招门道可多了。
So, you make it look very easy,
but actually, there's quite a lot to it.

248
00:12:41,800 --> 00:12:43,280
那么，咱们今天要教老太太们什么？
So, what are we going to be
teaching the grannies?

249
00:12:43,320 --> 00:12:45,280
我要让这群姑娘
从这个方向开过来，
I am going to get the girls
to come from this direction

250
00:12:45,320 --> 00:12:48,160
然后一把切进中间这个空当，
拉紧手刹，
and then turn in between this gap here,
pull on the handbrake,

251
00:12:48,200 --> 00:12:51,080
接着让车身横着滑进
两车之间的车位里。
and then slide the car sideways
in between the two cars.

252
00:12:51,120 --> 00:12:53,120
所以她们其实是要把整辆车
原地掉个头？
So they are actually going
to turn the whole car around?

253
00:12:53,160 --> 00:12:55,040
直接让车身旋转180度。
It's going to spin the car
through 180 degrees.

254
00:12:55,080 --> 00:12:56,560
全凭这一把手刹？
- 没错，全靠手刹。
And it's all on the handbrake?
- On the handbrake, yes.

255
00:12:56,600 --> 00:12:58,400
那这里面最难的是哪一部分？
So, what's the hardest part of this?

256
00:12:58,440 --> 00:12:59,480
讲究可多了去了。
There is lots of aspects to it.

257
00:12:59,520 --> 00:13:01,640
车速必须拿捏得刚刚好。
You have to get the speed right.

258
00:13:01,680 --> 00:13:03,680
要是开太快，你就会一路倒滑着
怼上后面那辆车。
If you go too fast, you end up
sliding backwards into the vehicle behind.

259
00:13:03,720 --> 00:13:05,320
要是速度提得不够，
If you don't get enough speed up,

260
00:13:05,360 --> 00:13:07,480
旋转的角度就不够，
转不满180度，
you wont get enough rotation
to get through 180 degrees

261
00:13:07,520 --> 00:13:09,280
剩下的就是找准时机
一把拉起手刹，
and then it's just a matter
of putting the handbrake on

262
00:13:09,320 --> 00:13:11,560
分毫不差地滑进车位里。
at the right time to end up in the space.

263
00:13:11,600 --> 00:13:14,480
他开得挺快啊。
- 确实快，真挺快。
He's going quite fast.
- He is, he is.

264
00:13:15,920 --> 00:13:20,360
[女士们的尖叫与欢笑声]
[WOMEN SCREAMING AND LAUGHING]

265
00:13:20,400 --> 00:13:23,800
女士：天呐，不要啊！
[众人惊呼]
WOMAN: Oh, no!
[ALL EXCLAIMING]

266
00:13:23,840 --> 00:13:26,120
我都等不及想看看
大家练得怎么样了。
I can't wait to find out
how you all got on.

267
00:13:26,160 --> 00:13:28,320
不过咱们待会儿再回来看结果，好吗？
But we're gonna come back later
and find out, all right?

268
00:13:28,360 --> 00:13:29,720
我还得去播《新闻》呢。
I've got to do The News.

269
00:13:29,760 --> 00:13:31,280
没问题。
- 回头见，拜！
All right.
- See you later. Bye.

270
00:13:32,360 --> 00:13:33,680
没错，咱们来聊点新闻。
Indeed, let's do some news.

271
00:13:33,720 --> 00:13:35,720
本周第一条，
And first up this week,

272
00:13:35,760 --> 00:13:38,800
日产据说要重返赛车界了。
哈蒙德：重返？
Nissan apparently are coming
back to motor sport.
