00:19:16,080 --> 00:19:20,880
你当然得这么开，毕竟是辆跑车——
它整台车就开始松垮乱晃了。
which you've got to, it's a sports car,
it came over all wobbly.

411
00:19:20,920 --> 00:19:25,160
所以，宝马这次在 Z4 身上，
绝对是想狂拉纯爷们的选票。
So, BMW really are chasing
the macho vote with the Z4.

412
00:19:25,200 --> 00:19:28,880
它尺寸更大、更凶悍，
而且结实硬朗得多，
It's bigger, bolder,
and much more substantial,

413
00:19:28,920 --> 00:19:34,320
活像一堆杀气腾腾的棱角、
曲面与交错线条拼成的产物。
an angry-looking collection
of angles, curves, and intersecting lines.

414
00:19:34,340 --> 00:19:37,340
♪ Ry Cooder - Paris, Texas ♪
♪ Ry Cooder - Paris, Texas ♪

415
00:19:37,680 --> 00:19:42,640
从某些角度看过去，它甚至有点像头犀牛，
还是说只有我一个人这么觉得？
From some views, it kind of resembles
a rhino, or is that just me?

416
00:19:48,960 --> 00:19:53,360
另外，注意个细节，
它叫 Z4，可不是什么“全新 Z3”。
Now, note something,
it is the Z4, not the new Z3.

417
00:19:53,400 --> 00:19:56,283
呃，他们总不可能把宝马 3 系
Well, they don't replace
the BMW 3-Series

418
00:19:56,308 --> 00:19:58,480
换代叫成宝马 4 系吧？对不对？
（理查德，这你可别打包票）
with the BMW 4-Series, do they?
(I wouldn't be so sure of that, Richard)

419
00:19:58,520 --> 00:20:02,480
很显然，宝马想彻底推倒重来，
做一辆彻头彻尾的全新车，
Clearly, BMW wanted to start
all over again with a completely new car,

420
00:20:02,520 --> 00:20:05,840
所以，很显然，老款车绝对是有硬伤的。
so, clearly, there was something wrong
with the old one.

421
00:20:07,400 --> 00:20:11,200
不过老款有一件事确实做得
非——常成功：那就是极其畅销。
One thing it did do very,
very well was sell.

422
00:20:11,240 --> 00:20:13,480
但说老实话，
But then if we're honest,

423
00:20:13,520 --> 00:20:17,240
你就算把宝马车标贴在死猫头上，
照样有人抢着买。
you could stick a BMW badge on a dead cat
and people would still buy it.

424
00:20:17,280 --> 00:20:21,200
现在很多人连实车都没见过一眼，
就已经掏钱下单买 Z4 了。
People are already buying
the Z4 now without ever seeing it.

425
00:20:21,240 --> 00:20:24,920
整整三万英镑大洋啊，
他们甚至连“试穿”都没试过！
Thirty grand and they've
never even tried it on!

426
00:20:26,640 --> 00:20:28,240
你们听明白了吧？
You did get that, didn't you?

427
00:20:28,280 --> 00:20:29,400
三万英镑。
Thirty grand.

428
00:20:29,440 --> 00:20:31,400
起步价至少三万。
At least 30 grand.

429
00:20:31,440 --> 00:20:33,160
这涨价幅度可真够狠的。
That's a big price hike.

430
00:20:33,200 --> 00:20:35,280
[发动机轰鸣声]
[ENGINE REVS]

431
00:20:35,300 --> 00:20:38,300
♪ Röyksopp - So Easy ♪
♪ Röyksopp - So Easy ♪

432
00:20:49,000 --> 00:20:51,840
它提供两款发动机可选，
全都是直列六缸，
There are two engines available,
both straight sixes,

433
00:20:51,880 --> 00:20:53,920
一款 2.5 升，一款 3.0 升。
a two-and-a-half litre or a three-litre.

434
00:20:56,840 --> 00:21:00,360
能选五速或六速手动变速箱，
而这台六速手动箱，
You can have a five-speed or a six-speed
manual, and the six-speed manual box,

435
00:21:00,400 --> 00:21:03,360
换起挡来，纯正扎实、极具机械质感。
it's a proper mechanical process,
changing gear.

436
00:21:03,400 --> 00:21:05,360
[发动机高转轰鸣]
[ENGINE REVVING]

437
00:21:05,400 --> 00:21:06,680
而且声浪听上去棒极了！
And it sounds great!

438
00:21:08,500 --> 00:21:11,500
♪ Small World - Livin’ Free ♪
♪ Small World - Livin’ Free ♪

439
00:21:16,400 --> 00:21:19,360
直六引擎撕扯般的啸叫，
总有一种让人欲罢不能的魔力！
There's something about
the yowl of a straight six!

440
00:21:20,440 --> 00:21:21,640
听得人热血沸腾。
It stirs the blood.

441
00:21:31,040 --> 00:21:33,320
全新的外观形象，更重要的是，
The new image, and more importantly,

442
00:21:33,360 --> 00:21:37,120
那翻新的价格标签，把Z4
直接砸进了一个截然不同的市场。
price tag, pitch the Z4
into an entirely different market.

443
00:21:37,160 --> 00:21:40,200
突然之间，光靠好玩
和一点花哨的小情趣可蒙混不过去了。
Suddenly, it's not enough
just be a bit of fluffy fun.

444
00:21:40,240 --> 00:21:43,560
它的对手名单里
赫然出现了奥迪TT敞篷版，
It's going to be on a list
that includes the Audi TT Roadster,

445
00:21:43,600 --> 00:21:45,960
还有保时捷Boxster——哎哟喂！
and the Porsche Boxster, yikes!

446
00:21:45,980 --> 00:21:48,980
♪ Röyksopp - Röyksopp’s Night Out ♪
♪ Röyksopp - Röyksopp’s Night Out ♪

447
00:21:59,520 --> 00:22:03,360
这抓地力简直深不见底，
It just has plenty of grip,

448
00:22:03,400 --> 00:22:05,440
说真的，强得离谱，
really, an awful lot of grip,

449
00:22:08,200 --> 00:22:09,520
甚至都多得过分了。
almost too much.

450
00:22:14,440 --> 00:22:19,320
我甚至都没逼出牵引力控制系统介入，
完全就是纯粹的抓地力。
I'm not even taxing the traction control,
that's just pure grip.

451
00:22:19,360 --> 00:22:22,880
在这玩意儿失去抓地力之前，
我自个儿就先吓尿了。
I'm gonna get scared
before this thing stops gripping.

452
00:22:24,000 --> 00:22:25,000
我继续逼它试试。
I'll keep trying.

453
00:22:38,080 --> 00:22:40,960
我太爱双座敞篷跑车了。
我甚至连“Roadster”这名字都爱得不行。
I really like roadsters.
I even like the name, Roadster.

454
00:22:41,000 --> 00:22:46,600
它骨子里带着股玩世不恭的张扬，
而且完美道出了这种车的精髓，
It's got a kind of
devil-may-care flamboyance to it
and it says a lot about the car,

455
00:22:46,640 --> 00:22:50,360
因为在纸面上，
你根本没法拿两台敞篷跑车比高低。
because you can't measure
roadsters on paper against one another.

456
00:22:50,400 --> 00:22:53,800
你不能因为冷冰冰的数据占优，
就断定这台比那台更好。
You can't decide this is better than that
because the figures say so.

457
00:22:53,840 --> 00:22:55,760
跑车讲究的是全身心的综合体验。
A roadster is about the whole experience.

458
00:22:55,800 --> 00:22:58,920
是那副皮囊，
是排气声浪，是握住方向盘时的感觉。
It's about the look,
the sound, the feel of it.

459
00:23:02,000 --> 00:23:05,000
♪ Doves - Words ♪
♪ Doves - Words ♪

460
00:23:14,120 --> 00:23:16,320
说实话，我觉得宝马这次搞明白了。
You know, I think they've cracked it.

461
00:23:16,360 --> 00:23:19,520
它确实没有保时捷Boxster跑得快，这是事实。
It's not as quick
as a Porsche Boxster, fact.

462
00:23:19,560 --> 00:23:23,480
但那又如何？这并不妨碍它成为优秀的选择。
况且，你本来就该对它寄予厚望。
But so? That doesn't rule it out. And
anyway, you'd expect this to be good.

463
00:23:23,520 --> 00:23:26,560
这可是Z4，不是过去的Z3。
This is a Z4, not a Z3.

464
00:23:26,600 --> 00:23:28,640
这声势硬是高了一个档次。
This is one louder.

465
00:23:28,680 --> 00:23:31,880
[引擎轰鸣]
[轮胎尖叫]
[ENGINE REVVING]
[TYRES SCREECH]

