Right. This is the cool board,
which is something I've just thought of.

467
00:23:40,200 --> 00:23:41,760
明白吗？规矩极其简单。
Okay? Perfectly simple.

468
00:23:41,800 --> 00:23:44,480
我们把市面上的车
划分成了四个档次。
We've divided a range of cars
into four categories.

469
00:23:44,520 --> 00:23:46,480
“土得掉渣”。
Seriously Uncool.

470
